{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "english", "appid": 553850, "month": "2024-04", "window": 4, "start_date": 1713916800, "end_date": 1714521599, "month_true_total": 47454, "quota": 20, "returned": 20, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:15:02 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "163949314", "author": {"steamid": "76561198078142176", "personaname": "TerranGenesis", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198078142176/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 17202, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4441, "last_played": 1783788347, "avatar": "61ce2dca82be83d66ccd05e44dc775fff26b0e7b"}, "language": "english", "review": "I do not recoomend buying this game or giving it the light of day considering how the Devs do not respect your time and money spent in the game.\n\nEvery time they add something in the game and it is fun they make sure to nerf it.\n\nIt is a designer choice they say, designer choice or no designer choice, when an update annihilates the fun of the game, makes everything a chore and implements ridiculous mechanics richochets for weapons that will hit you every time and instantly kill you, well i do not see point a pont to spend my hard earned cash and limited time to play this game and neither should you.\n\nWhether or not you give the game the light of day is up to you, but I feel like the Dev team is being hostile towards the playerbase and it will only get worse from there.\n\nIf it sounds like I am emotional, that is cause I am heatbroken with the direction in which this game is going, I thought it will be the next co-op game after Mass Effect 3 where i would spend years playing with my friends but sadly it is not meant to be.\nNot to mention that he friend list is still not working months after the release....", "timestamp_created": 1714521566, "timestamp_updated": 1714521659, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 6, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 