5a2f19fa00e321737b87bfe4acc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Devs hate all play styles that don't fit their little box.\nIf the community finds a viable long range gun they will nerf it until it's not worth running over a standard full auto weapon. \nWouldn't be as big of a deal but when you buy a new gun with super credits they nerf it in under a week which makes you very spiteful .\n\nif only the game wasnt also blatantly becoming a micro transaction trap I might feel differently.\nNerfing the best guns in the game a few days before releasing something which can be bought with real cash is big ♥♥♥♥ YOU \ni have 900 super creds so I am actually not able to buy the new warbond, some folks can buy it if they haven't bought the other ones, a lot of people are probably super close like i am. \n\nThats cool, its a good system honestly. \n\nBut not if you are nerfing the best guns from the PREVIOUS warbond that you JUST UNLOCKED right before you release new ♥♥♥♥\nthere will be a very large percentage of people who pay between 2 and 10 dollars to unlock actual IN GAME content that can make you better at the game. \n\nblizzard sell horse that does nothing\nSony sell legit gun\nBlizzard bad sony good \ni changed my review to negative and im not playing anymore\nyou cant do \"balance nerfs\" and also release weapons that a majority of people will have to pay for\nif you are gonna release paid ♥♥♥♥ you dont get to nerf the ♥♥♥♥ we bought last week or you are deep into scumbag territory.\n\nGood job idiots, you turned a good game into trash.", "timestamp_created": 1714520453, "timestamp_updated": 1714769048, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495796620845794678", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}]}